{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26512","headline":"酬范中丞见 · 费冠卿","name":"酬范中丞见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花宫柳陌正从行，紫袂金鞍问姓名。\n战国方须礼干木，康时何必重侯嬴。\n捧将束帛山僮喜，传示银钩邑客惊。\n直爲云泥相去远，一言知己杀身轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"费冠卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}